WEBVTT

00:10.660 --> 00:15.490
Now, the Mirei Middle School Beauty
Contest reaches its thrilling climax!

00:15.490 --> 00:17.530
And your winner is...

00:20.290 --> 00:22.370
Eiai Nano-san!

00:24.740 --> 00:26.920
Eiai-san, how does it feel to win?

00:27.550 --> 00:29.980
I was only entered by mistake.

00:29.980 --> 00:31.700
I wish to leave already.

00:32.130 --> 00:35.630
I... lost? Who, me?

00:37.000 --> 00:40.350
But beauty does not lie.

00:40.910 --> 00:44.990
Not accepting this result is the same
as casting doubt on beauty itself.

00:45.910 --> 00:49.370
A pleasure competing
against you, Eiai-san.

00:49.370 --> 00:53.780
Next, may we aim to achieve
peak beauty together, as friends.

00:57.950 --> 00:59.490
Friendship is meaningless.

01:01.220 --> 01:04.900
Any time spent on it would be
a complete and utter waste.

01:24.680 --> 01:29.890
(The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really,
Really, Really, REALLY Love You)

01:30.720 --> 01:33.560
(Karane
as the Tsundere Princess)

01:33.560 --> 01:35.850
(Demonstration
Tea-Time Prep)

01:35.850 --> 01:37.440
(Hakari
Suggestive Weight-Loss Running)

01:37.440 --> 01:38.690
(Kurumi
Ate all of the school store's bread)

01:38.690 --> 01:40.190
(Mimimi
(Getting ready) Two hours later)

01:41.360 --> 01:43.900
(Nano
Robot that exercises for her)

01:43.900 --> 01:46.320
(Shizuka
Has 365 book recommendations this week)

01:46.320 --> 01:48.620
(Kusuri
Has newly developed drug
that gives you sweet dreams)

01:48.620 --> 01:49.280
(Hahari
Chairperson's Address "Education" and "Love")

01:49.280 --> 01:49.950
(Iku
Has been doing push-ups since yesterday)

01:49.950 --> 01:51.490
(Meme
Customized Plushy- Rentaro-kun)

01:51.620 --> 01:56.330
(Rentaro-kun Appreciation Opening)

01:59.080 --> 02:00.750
(Meme-san added ears
and a tail for you!)

02:06.380 --> 02:08.430
(Rentaro-kun (& Others) Appreciation Opening)

02:43.010 --> 02:44.840
Eiai Nano.

02:44.840 --> 02:46.770
Today is the day I emerge victorious.

02:47.230 --> 02:51.020
Today, I will exorcise the
demons of that day.

02:51.360 --> 02:55.060
So, to decide who gets exiled
from the Rentaro Family,

02:55.060 --> 02:59.030
Utsukushisugi-senpai and Nano will
face off in a beauty search contest.

03:04.450 --> 03:06.160
Start calling!

03:06.160 --> 03:08.410
Hold it right there!

03:08.410 --> 03:13.180
What the heck is a "beauty search"?!
Fill me and the viewers in first!

03:13.180 --> 03:14.920
The beauty search is...

03:16.380 --> 03:18.420
a search for beauty.

03:18.420 --> 03:22.180
Says as much on the tin!
I'm asking for d-e-tails!

03:24.820 --> 03:26.640
Allow me to explain!

03:26.640 --> 03:29.050
The competitors, Eiai Nano and me-me-me,

03:29.050 --> 03:34.620
will find and call out a quality that makes
the subject—the nine of you—beautiful.

03:34.620 --> 03:37.070
Aijo-kun will be the judge.

03:37.070 --> 03:40.650
If he declares that quality
beautiful, we score one point.

03:40.650 --> 03:45.780
Whoever scores the most points
on each subject wins the round,

03:45.780 --> 03:50.450
and whoever wins the most rounds
at the end of all nine...

03:50.450 --> 03:51.870
will be named the victor!

03:52.460 --> 03:56.410
Yeah, no. We can't kick out a family
member based on this nonsense.

03:56.410 --> 03:58.210
I assure you, it isn't nonsense.

03:58.840 --> 04:02.520
The sport's officially recognized by the
World Beauty Association in Christchurch!

04:02.520 --> 04:04.840
Well, I ain't ever heard of this church!

04:05.200 --> 04:08.280
Anyway, the contest is already underway.

04:08.280 --> 04:09.850
And the first subject...

04:10.940 --> 04:13.290
is you, Inda Karane-san!

04:13.290 --> 04:15.230
Wha? D-Don't give me that crap!

04:15.530 --> 04:17.860
Subject, my ass! Why would I ever—

04:17.860 --> 04:18.610
Call.

04:18.930 --> 04:20.140
Come on, call!

04:20.140 --> 04:22.990
Her pursuit of every last detail

04:22.990 --> 04:25.240
set up a perfect flow for this episode.

04:25.240 --> 04:26.910
Beautiful, indeed!

04:27.770 --> 04:28.940
Yes, beauty!

04:28.940 --> 04:31.680
Utsukushisugi-senpai gets one point!

04:31.680 --> 04:34.670
Where'd you even learn the referee calls?

04:35.020 --> 04:36.380
You can't just...

04:36.730 --> 04:37.480
Call.

04:37.480 --> 04:38.610
Come on, call!

04:38.610 --> 04:42.010
Her wide, upturned,
almond-shaped eyes are beautiful.

04:42.790 --> 04:44.120
Yes, beauty!

04:44.120 --> 04:45.980
Nano gets one point!

04:45.980 --> 04:47.160
How about...

04:47.160 --> 04:50.120
Her shiny golden pigtails are beautiful!

04:50.120 --> 04:51.010
How...

04:51.010 --> 04:53.540
Her slender physique is beautiful.

04:54.020 --> 04:56.920
Her trendy schoolgirl fashion
is beautiful!

04:56.920 --> 04:58.740
Her straightforward heart is beautiful.

04:58.740 --> 05:01.160
Her reactions are obvious and beautiful!

05:01.160 --> 05:03.340
Her secret passionate side is beautiful.

05:05.880 --> 05:07.360
Her mature grace!

05:07.360 --> 05:08.410
Her love for others.

05:08.410 --> 05:09.410
Oh, my.

05:09.410 --> 05:11.390
Her emerald eyes!

05:11.390 --> 05:12.830
Her impeccable table manners.

05:12.830 --> 05:14.660
Th-The heck?

05:14.660 --> 05:16.900
Her carefully groomed black hair!

05:16.900 --> 05:18.280
Her perfect etiquette.

05:18.280 --> 05:19.790
I am not worthy.

05:19.790 --> 05:21.390
The curve of her antenna!

05:21.390 --> 05:23.180
Her passion for pharmaceutical studies.

05:23.180 --> 05:24.590
Booyaye.

05:24.590 --> 05:26.920
Her pearly whites that peek out
when she grins!

05:26.920 --> 05:28.510
Her sporty sweat-drenched look.

05:29.220 --> 05:30.900
A busty high school girl!

05:30.900 --> 05:32.140
With sophisticated mannerisms.

05:32.140 --> 05:33.350
Oh, please!

05:34.510 --> 05:36.850
You've fought admirably.

05:37.150 --> 05:40.770
You took the brunt of my eye
for beauty and lived to tell the tale.

05:40.770 --> 05:43.300
Was this supposed to be a combat sport?

05:44.620 --> 05:49.740
Nano-san will take an insurmountable
lead if she wins this next round.

05:49.740 --> 05:51.870
And the next subject is...

05:52.260 --> 05:53.690
Shizuka-san!

05:53.690 --> 05:57.120
Nano-san and Shizuka-san
spend a lot of time together.

05:57.580 --> 06:02.880
It's too bad for Utsukushisugi-senpai,
but Nano-san has the upper hand.

06:03.230 --> 06:04.810
Start calling!

06:04.810 --> 06:05.610
Call.

06:06.300 --> 06:07.290
She made the first move!

06:07.290 --> 06:08.130
Come on, call!

06:08.500 --> 06:11.180
Her quiet and subdued nature makes her...

06:11.180 --> 06:12.100
cute.

06:15.780 --> 06:18.020
No, not beauty.

06:18.020 --> 06:20.670
That's cute. No point.

06:21.690 --> 06:27.030
I called out a cute quality in a contest
about beauty. What was I thinking?

06:27.340 --> 06:28.280
Call.

06:28.280 --> 06:29.630
Come on, call!

06:29.630 --> 06:32.030
Her exemplary, rule-abiding...

06:32.030 --> 06:33.530
long skirt!

06:33.890 --> 06:35.170
Yes, beauty!

06:35.170 --> 06:37.540
Utsukushisugi-senpai gets one point!

06:38.760 --> 06:39.680
Call.

06:39.680 --> 06:40.790
Come on, call!

06:41.130 --> 06:43.960
The way she expresses her feelings
with small gestures is cute.

06:44.470 --> 06:46.100
Not beauty.

06:46.100 --> 06:48.550
That's cute. No point.

06:53.050 --> 06:55.950
Round 8 goes to Utsukushisugi-senpai.

06:55.950 --> 06:57.560
Mm, indeed!

06:58.260 --> 07:01.370
A catastrophic error
has occurred in my brain.

07:01.370 --> 07:06.780
Shizuka-senpai's cuteness
can make even Nano-senpai bug out.

07:06.780 --> 07:08.940
Her love only caused her defeat!

07:09.330 --> 07:11.630
They're now tied at four each.

07:11.630 --> 07:14.450
It'll all be decided
in this ninth round...

07:14.760 --> 07:16.860
And I'm the last subject.

07:16.860 --> 07:22.500
The beauty they find in me
will decide which of them gets exiled!

07:24.280 --> 07:27.260
I'll judge this game fairly,

07:27.260 --> 07:29.040
or I will perish trying.

07:29.040 --> 07:30.220
Chill, girl.

07:30.540 --> 07:32.040
Start calling.

07:32.040 --> 07:32.840
Call.

07:32.840 --> 07:33.970
Come on, call.

07:33.970 --> 07:36.470
His immaculately groomed thick brows!

07:40.280 --> 07:44.520
I agree. Rentaro-sama's esteemed brow
is stately and beautiful.

07:44.520 --> 07:46.290
Yes, beauty. One point...

07:46.290 --> 07:47.370
Wait a second.

07:48.590 --> 07:50.740
Are you sure about that?

07:53.780 --> 07:56.990
Thine honorable browies have gone missing!

07:56.990 --> 08:01.460
Eek! Rentaro-chan's
fluffy-wuffy browy-wowies!

08:01.460 --> 08:02.690
Who dis?!

08:02.690 --> 08:04.120
What happened, Rentaro?!

08:05.660 --> 08:06.770
I shaved them.

08:06.770 --> 08:08.200
He shaved them!

08:10.210 --> 08:12.030
N-Not beauty.

08:12.030 --> 08:14.200
That's funny. No point.

08:14.200 --> 08:15.870
No way, I say!

08:15.870 --> 08:16.570
Call.

08:16.570 --> 08:17.640
Come on, call.

08:17.940 --> 08:19.600
His prim-and-proper uniform style.

08:22.510 --> 08:25.230
R-Rentaro-chan!

08:28.250 --> 08:29.890
N-Not beauty.

08:29.890 --> 08:32.320
That's crazy. No point.

08:32.610 --> 08:35.240
What are you doing, Aijo-kun?

08:35.240 --> 08:39.080
No matter. I must defeat Eiai Nano!

08:39.590 --> 08:42.830
I must win and remain with my family.

08:45.970 --> 08:47.640
His standard black hair!

08:48.340 --> 08:50.660
His balanced posture.

08:50.660 --> 08:52.080
His facial features!

08:52.080 --> 08:53.770
His pure heart.

08:54.840 --> 08:56.340
Time's up!

08:59.600 --> 09:01.350
R-Rentaro...

09:02.290 --> 09:04.600
No. At this point...

09:07.240 --> 09:09.750
He's the creature
formerly known as Rentaro!

09:10.360 --> 09:13.240
Both competitors scored
zero points for this round.

09:15.850 --> 09:17.110
In other words...

09:17.110 --> 09:19.950
The beauty search contest ends in a draw.

09:19.950 --> 09:23.120
Nobody has lost,
and nobody will be exiled!

09:26.040 --> 09:28.970
He did this to prevent either of them
from having to leave.

09:28.970 --> 09:32.620
He sacrificed himself
and turned into that cursed form...

09:33.730 --> 09:36.700
No, look deeper.

09:36.700 --> 09:41.140
That look... is a symbol
of his endless love for us!

09:42.330 --> 09:43.940
It's so beautiful!

09:43.940 --> 09:44.740
You need an eye doc.

09:44.740 --> 09:45.890
No, a brain surgeon.

09:47.070 --> 09:48.400
In this battle...

09:48.810 --> 09:53.530
A draw against Eiai Nano
is no better than a loss!

09:55.510 --> 09:59.210
Farewell, Aijo-kun.
I wish you the best with Eiai Nano.

09:59.210 --> 10:01.160
No! Why?

10:01.160 --> 10:02.030
Wait.

10:03.970 --> 10:07.020
I'm sorry, Utsukushisugi Mimimi.

10:07.020 --> 10:10.480
I trampled all over your feelings
back on that day.

10:11.490 --> 10:13.050
It's too late now.

10:13.340 --> 10:16.800
It is all too late. But...

10:17.380 --> 10:22.050
By meeting Aijo Rentaro and everyone here,
I've learned many things.

10:22.890 --> 10:24.970
The value of spending time with others.

10:25.330 --> 10:27.390
The indescribable warmth of love.

10:28.130 --> 10:33.190
I also learned the gravity of the things
I dismissed as meaningless in the past.

10:34.460 --> 10:36.600
That is why I agreed to this contest.

10:37.010 --> 10:40.570
I wanted to accept your offer this time.

10:42.200 --> 10:45.830
I realize that I have no right
to ask now, but...

10:51.340 --> 10:52.880
if there's any chance at all,

10:53.560 --> 10:56.100
I would like...

11:10.580 --> 11:13.610
I want to be friends with you too.

11:14.280 --> 11:15.230
Wha?!

11:22.740 --> 11:26.740
Eiai-san! What a beautiful being!

11:27.240 --> 11:30.020
How I want to make her acquaintance!

11:32.710 --> 11:34.100
I know!

11:34.100 --> 11:37.880
I'll secretly enter her
into the beauty contest.

11:38.430 --> 11:41.630
It will be the start
of a beautiful friendship.

11:42.520 --> 11:48.010
And we will aim to achieve
peak beauty together, as friends!

11:49.930 --> 11:52.010
H-How can you say this now?

11:52.010 --> 11:55.940
It is far, far too late!

11:57.240 --> 12:01.280
It is far too late for you
to realize how beautiful I am!

12:01.630 --> 12:03.780
Uh, I didn't say that.

12:04.090 --> 12:05.830
If you so insist,

12:05.830 --> 12:09.040
I'll allow you the privilege
of being my friend!

12:12.520 --> 12:13.710
Mm!

12:18.870 --> 12:20.130
And there you have it.

12:20.440 --> 12:21.950
May I have your permission

12:21.950 --> 12:27.860
to formally welcome Utsukushisugi
Mimimi-senpai as my newest girlfriend?

12:27.860 --> 12:31.020
I shall allow you the privilege of my
exalted presence in your family!

12:31.020 --> 12:33.640
I know those words,
but no clue what they mean together.

12:33.950 --> 12:36.150
Meh, I don't see why not.

12:36.690 --> 12:39.150
She seems dumb as bricks,
but not actually a bad girl.

12:39.150 --> 12:41.810
Mm? Who are we talking about?

12:41.810 --> 12:44.780
Welcome to the family, Mimimi-senpai.

12:44.780 --> 12:48.570
But hey, she not stuck-up for nothing.

12:48.570 --> 12:50.040
Mimimi real hot.

12:51.350 --> 12:53.490
Was that a compliment?

12:53.490 --> 12:56.940
Well, it must've been!
It's me we're talking about here!

12:56.940 --> 12:58.290
That's exactly it.

12:58.620 --> 13:01.970
Rest assured, Kusuri-senpai and everyone.

13:01.970 --> 13:04.990
I will turn you into a family
befitting a knockout such as myself

13:04.990 --> 13:07.600
by making you leagues more beautiful!

13:12.220 --> 13:14.550
Starting with some makeup.

13:15.260 --> 13:16.600
And some more.

13:17.470 --> 13:18.980
That tickles!

13:19.670 --> 13:21.360
All in a day's work, I must say.

13:23.930 --> 13:27.130
Whee! Kusuri transform, aye!

13:27.130 --> 13:32.440
Now gaze sadly into the distance
to emphasize your feminine charms.

13:32.440 --> 13:33.830
Right.

13:36.630 --> 13:37.870
Are you even trying?

13:39.030 --> 13:43.310
But I must admit, their natural
beauty levels are unnaturally high.

13:43.310 --> 13:47.000
Few of them seem to take
any special measures, so how?

13:48.130 --> 13:49.640
Rentaro!

13:49.900 --> 13:52.030
Kusuri beautiful?

13:52.030 --> 13:53.390
You're cute-iful!

13:54.490 --> 13:56.890
Then gimme a kissy, aye!

13:57.880 --> 13:59.840
In broad daylight?

13:59.840 --> 14:03.530
Are you all kissing him frequently?

14:03.530 --> 14:04.700
W-Well...

14:04.700 --> 14:06.360
Not that much.

14:06.700 --> 14:08.740
This reminds me of something I've heard...

14:08.740 --> 14:14.190
Sharing a kiss with your lover leads to
the secretion of hormones vital for beauty.

14:14.190 --> 14:17.000
It is the most potent
beauty therapy in existence!

14:17.000 --> 14:21.310
That's it! We must all kiss
Rentaro-kun loads!

14:21.310 --> 14:21.960
Huh?!

14:21.960 --> 14:24.320
Don't know what's going on, but agreed!

14:24.320 --> 14:25.800
Now hold on a second!

14:26.350 --> 14:27.720
Rentaro-chan...

14:27.720 --> 14:31.430
We want to be even more beautiful for you.

14:31.430 --> 14:36.440
But, Mother,
we mustn't be a burden to him.

14:37.310 --> 14:40.730
How could kissing you all
ever be a burden to me?!

14:40.730 --> 14:42.780
I can do this!

14:42.780 --> 14:45.230
Kusuri got just the drug!

14:45.230 --> 14:49.090
The Kissy-Kissy Bang-Bang Lip Balm!

14:49.090 --> 14:50.140
An aphrodisiac?!

14:50.140 --> 14:54.650
I see. The stronger the pleasure,
the more the brain stimuli.

14:54.650 --> 14:57.000
It may lead to increased
secretion of hormones.

14:58.890 --> 15:00.500
Experimentation before speculation.

15:03.150 --> 15:06.270
That's my Nano-san!
Such beautiful efficiency!

15:06.270 --> 15:10.010
She's like a race car with the brakes
taken out to reduce weight.

15:14.250 --> 15:16.460
This is beyond expectations.

15:16.460 --> 15:21.270
It's like injecting pure joy
into my brain... and pleasure.

15:23.250 --> 15:27.420
I feel it coursing through my veins
and taking over my entire body!

15:33.540 --> 15:34.530
Did she just fwomp?!

15:35.340 --> 15:37.210
"Sesemannano sat down."

15:37.720 --> 15:40.410
So this is what it means
to go weak in the knees.

15:41.000 --> 15:42.670
A-Are you okay...

15:42.930 --> 15:43.880
Nano?

15:45.370 --> 15:47.070
Wh-What's going on?

15:47.070 --> 15:49.960
I'm spacing out so much more
than our usual kisses.

15:49.960 --> 15:52.550
Is the lip balm affecting me too?

15:52.550 --> 15:55.720
Kusuri wanna bang-bang kiss too!

15:55.720 --> 15:57.430
Don't make it sound like that!

15:57.820 --> 15:59.490
Hwah?

15:59.490 --> 16:04.780
Kusuri body feel weird.
Feel funny between legs.

16:04.780 --> 16:06.190
Like, like...

16:07.220 --> 16:08.180
Rentaro!

16:08.180 --> 16:09.460
Love you!

16:11.190 --> 16:16.000
Kusuri feel like leaking
every drop of pee in body!

16:16.000 --> 16:17.370
You're leaking all right!

16:22.740 --> 16:26.070
Kusuri sorry for leaking on live TV, aye.

16:27.150 --> 16:29.970
Whew, that felt really good, aye.

16:29.970 --> 16:31.720
That's a different kind of pleasure.

16:31.720 --> 16:34.830
What? Please, enlighten us.

16:34.830 --> 16:37.000
Let's chwange your diapies!

16:39.630 --> 16:41.160
There, that should do it.

16:41.160 --> 16:44.750
B-But I ought to go last.

16:44.750 --> 16:48.400
It's fine. We'll run outta time
if we wait for those morons.

16:52.900 --> 16:57.580
I-I am not worthy of such pleasures!

16:57.580 --> 16:59.420
Oh, Rentaro-sama...

16:59.420 --> 17:03.550
Why must you bless me with such joy?!

17:03.550 --> 17:04.960
I love you!

17:04.960 --> 17:07.670
I love you with all I have, Rentaro-sama!

17:10.380 --> 17:11.560
Sitting on cue?!

17:12.330 --> 17:13.760
I must allow Hahari-sama her turn.

17:13.760 --> 17:16.250
Mei like a puppy! Shake!

17:16.740 --> 17:17.330
Woof?

17:17.330 --> 17:18.300
Mei-san!

17:18.770 --> 17:20.510
Come, Rentaro-chan.

17:26.890 --> 17:30.070
I wuv you, I wuv you, I wuv you!

17:30.550 --> 17:32.320
Why is it so hot out here?!

17:32.320 --> 17:34.190
You're an educator, not a sex educator!

17:35.960 --> 17:38.820
No, Rentaro-chan!

17:39.100 --> 17:43.500
Heh... So, can I kiss you too, Rentaro?

17:43.500 --> 17:45.750
Iku? You don't have to ask.

17:49.330 --> 17:52.960
S-So this is the kiss
that made everyone buckle!

17:53.300 --> 17:54.340
Rentaro!

17:54.340 --> 17:57.220
Love you! I love you so much!

17:57.220 --> 18:01.970
It feels too good,
but I'll bear it as long as I can!

18:02.540 --> 18:05.230
If I give up, the game's over
right then and there!

18:05.470 --> 18:07.320
You need those ACLs and MCLs!

18:07.320 --> 18:09.390
You must stop, Iku-sama!

18:09.390 --> 18:12.910
Hmph! It's not like I care about a kiss.

18:12.910 --> 18:15.660
Then why apply the lip balm?

18:15.660 --> 18:18.250
"Such is the cross she must bear."

18:18.740 --> 18:23.260
H-Hey, why are you leaning in
for a kiss? Who said you...

18:23.260 --> 18:25.050
Because you're cute, Karane.

18:27.400 --> 18:31.000
I love, love, love, Rentaro!

18:31.000 --> 18:32.370
Kiss me more!

18:32.370 --> 18:35.740
Kiss me forever and ever and ever!

18:36.300 --> 18:38.580
His spine has left the building!

18:38.580 --> 18:39.380
Gulp.

18:41.610 --> 18:45.170
Wha? I-It's not like I was hugging him!

18:45.170 --> 18:46.850
Your gaslighting skill needs work.

18:46.850 --> 18:50.220
She isn't lying.
That was a wrestling bearhug.

18:50.220 --> 18:51.020
In that case,

18:51.020 --> 18:53.250
I'll be the one to judge!

18:54.270 --> 18:56.400
Y-You okay there?

18:57.060 --> 19:00.620
What? Sorry, I wasn't paying attention.

19:00.620 --> 19:02.280
You've got issues of your own.

19:09.530 --> 19:11.350
Huh? Why?

19:14.920 --> 19:18.100
Ah, I love him. I love Rentaro-senpai.

19:18.100 --> 19:21.300
I love Rentaro-senpai,
and I love kissing him!

19:21.300 --> 19:23.390
I want another taste!

19:24.310 --> 19:26.050
Stop! Y-You can't, Kurumi!

19:26.050 --> 19:27.760
Come on, Senpai.

19:27.760 --> 19:31.060
Don't treat me like a kid
just 'cause I'm younger.

19:31.320 --> 19:33.050
Shizuka-chan's watching!

19:33.050 --> 19:34.060
My bad!

19:37.410 --> 19:39.360
Now you, Shizuka-chan.

19:40.760 --> 19:41.980
"Bring it."

19:43.910 --> 19:46.020
I love you, Rentaro-kun.

19:46.020 --> 19:48.180
I love you... I love you so much!

19:48.180 --> 19:52.020
Oh no... I can't think of
anything but Rentaro-kun!

19:52.020 --> 19:56.030
It's like my head and my body...
It's all floating...

19:56.030 --> 19:57.420
All floating away...

19:58.850 --> 20:00.840
Away-way-way!

20:00.840 --> 20:02.040
Shizuka-chan!

20:02.040 --> 20:03.090
No, my legs...

20:06.670 --> 20:07.600
Are you unhurt,

20:07.600 --> 20:09.350
Yoshimoto Shizuka?

20:10.270 --> 20:11.730
Yoshimoto Shizuka?

20:12.040 --> 20:14.350
Now it's my turn.

20:20.410 --> 20:22.650
It feels so, so good!

20:22.650 --> 20:24.350
I've never felt this way before!

20:24.350 --> 20:26.820
Rentaro-kun! Rentaro-kun! Rentaro-kun!

20:26.820 --> 20:28.620
Kuntaro-ren! Kuntaro-ren!

20:35.500 --> 20:37.040
Rocket nosebleed!

20:37.040 --> 20:38.180
Hakari!

20:39.110 --> 20:40.670
I... I'm still...

20:44.170 --> 20:46.810
Hey! You okay over there?!

20:46.810 --> 20:47.800
Hwh?

20:48.090 --> 20:50.180
Hakari? Hakari!

20:51.140 --> 20:52.400
Kuntaro-kun?

20:52.400 --> 20:53.310
Whomst?!

21:05.000 --> 21:07.070
You f... stop...

21:10.030 --> 21:12.010
Now, Rentaro-kun.

21:12.980 --> 21:15.480
I hope you're ready.

21:15.480 --> 21:18.580
The time has come for you
to kiss me in all my beauty.

21:18.580 --> 21:20.420
Y-Yes!

21:22.760 --> 21:27.090
The more I look at her,
the clearer it is how beautiful she is!

21:31.010 --> 21:33.110
So this is what a kiss is like.

21:33.110 --> 21:36.050
Oh, how wonderful it feels!

21:36.050 --> 21:41.280
My beautiful brain is braining out
all the hormones! I can tell!

21:41.740 --> 21:44.360
I can't stop it, I can't...

21:44.700 --> 21:47.560
I'm becoming more and more beautiful!

21:47.560 --> 21:50.440
"Just like in Food Wars."

21:50.440 --> 21:52.370
Instead of the Maillard Reaction,
we get hormones!

21:52.370 --> 21:57.570
Come, everyone.
Kiss Rentaro-kun more and be beautiful!

21:57.570 --> 21:59.290
Agreed!

22:04.590 --> 22:07.800
Phew. That should do it for the day.

22:07.800 --> 22:10.930
Just how beautiful are we now?

22:11.220 --> 22:13.430
Huh? Y-You girls...

22:14.040 --> 22:15.300
You changed art style!

22:16.390 --> 22:17.730
Wowie!

22:17.730 --> 22:19.680
And you became an art piece!
